# ASSETS' CP2077 item/mod icons are copied in here at deploy time and must
# NEVER be committed (the lead, 2026-11-08). Source of truth on the test rig:
#   the extracted assets folder, icons\png\  (+ icons-manifest.json)
#
# This is a WHITELIST, not a list of known prefixes. SPEC's 2026-11-08 push cut
# ten more CP icons whose names (AgileJoints.png, T_1000.png, icon_tattoo_tyger.png,
# ...) matched none of the cw_*/cwf_* patterns this file used to list, so they
# turned up as untracked and would have been committed. Ignore everything, then
# name the few files this view actually owns.
*
!.gitignore
!slot-*.png
!body-scan.png
